    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Give my regards to the princess, if you see her first.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Keep that fear. It's the only thing keeping you alive.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""See you around. Sooner than you'd like.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Pray if it helps. Nobody's listening.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Remember my name. Ganondorf. You'll be saying it a lot.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Back to your stall. The world ends on my schedule.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Go on. I've wasted enough time on you.",
